    "measurementTechnique": [
      "For each transect, a 50 meter measuring tape was laid across the ground.",
      "Then, at each 50 centimeter increment along the transect, a vertical rod was inserted in the ground and any living plant or substrate touching the rod was recorded from top to bottom. For each plant, the plant functional type and species name was identified and recorded.",
      "Using an Emlid device, GPS latitude and longitude coordinates were recorded at the 0 meter, 25 meter (midpoint), and 50 meter points for each transect."
